  "created": "2021-02-13T13:55:20.595Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Many methods on `TMProTextMeshPro` are not exposed in Udon which disallows precise working with the text and its vertices. E.g. animating text or performing effects on the mesh. Imagine wavy text, jumping text, rotating text, and growing text.\nThis canny requests to expose API such as:\n- `ForceMeshUpdate`\n- `UpdateGeometry`\n- `maxDisplayedChars`\n- `textInfo`\n\nThe text info is very important as it allows access to the `meshInfo` on each character mesh and the `vertices`.\nThe `meshInfo` exposes `mesh.vertices` and `vertices`, both are different and crucial.",
